PRIMARY METRIC DEFINITIONS:

  A = GT union area / document-content area

  E = CAM relevance mass inside GT union
      / total CAM relevance mass inside document content

  mu_w = E / A

  PG = 1 if strongest content CAM point falls in GT union

  mu_w = 1 corresponds to spatially uniform CAM mass.

The artificial horizontal padding is excluded from A/E/mu_w/PG and audited separately.

